        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7e165efe-e7b2-3951-822a-9df262a404cd",
                "word": "influencer",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "580a5bb2-c646-3525-b88b-a570fc1be564",
                        "entry_id": "7e165efe-e7b2-3951-822a-9df262a404cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "osoba mająca wpływ na opinie i decyzje innych, zwykle twórca internetowy o znacznym rozgłosie posiadający znaczne grono odbiorców"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "206cd954-4807-4fc7-9881-fc9404c3d91e",
                                "sense_id": "580a5bb2-c646-3525-b88b-a570fc1be564",
                                "text": "Influencerzy umiejętnie budują wokół siebie grupę lojalnych odbiorców, z którymi łączą ich silne relacje i zainteresowania"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5564465b-9302-4bae-8ad4-067f40a60b68",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e165efe-e7b2-3951-822a-9df262a404cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "580a5bb2-c646-3525-b88b-a570fc1be564",
                        "target_lang_word": "influencer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "influencer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9903a128-60da-3842-8f8b-ffd813487398",
                                        "entry_id": "a176dab6-3dfa-32ec-8f80-fdead534d262",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who or a thing which influences."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb9da03a-1fa3-3ec2-a9d6-4d646f216185",
                                        "entry_id": "a176dab6-3dfa-32ec-8f80-fdead534d262",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is able to influence consumption, lifestyle, or political preferences of their online audience by creating or engaging social media content, often as a part of a marketing campaign."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05898493-e0d7-4269-9e08-0b1cb12c53ba",
                                                "sense_id": "cb9da03a-1fa3-3ec2-a9d6-4d646f216185",
                                                "text": "By now you have probably heard of influencers, that group of internet-famous people who have more than a million social media followers and can make big money by plugging various brands. And you may have even heard of microinfluencers, who do the same thing for a still sizable but somewhat smaller social media audience — from the tens to low hundreds of thousands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96900ca8-194e-4404-8131-b277421b45ef",
                                                "sense_id": "cb9da03a-1fa3-3ec2-a9d6-4d646f216185",
                                                "text": "The idea of an influencer economy or streaming economy might have caused eyes to roll just a couple years ago, but the reality is that this segment of the economy is growing fast. More importantly, it is the part of the economy (and type of engagement) that is most appealing to the increasingly important millennial and Gen-Z cohorts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20b35877-f1f7-46e0-9986-167c741996cb",
                                                "sense_id": "cb9da03a-1fa3-3ec2-a9d6-4d646f216185",
                                                "text": "Over the past year, mansions full of young influencers have proliferated across the United States (in Los Angeles, Dallas and Las Vegas) and around the world (France, the U.K., Mexico, Spain and Russia)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4daac016-16e8-4c97-95aa-89234be59bd3",
                                                "sense_id": "cb9da03a-1fa3-3ec2-a9d6-4d646f216185",
                                                "text": "The idea of an alleged Epstein \"list\" was turbocharged by Trump's own inner circle, most notably by Bondi herself. In a February interview with Fox News, she claimed, \"The list of Jeffrey Epstein's clients is sitting on my desk.\" Her remark, quickly amplified by right-wing influencers, fueled weeks of speculation online and in MAGA circles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "290b77f7-2774-4d86-bd2a-a9dd3930c815",
                                                "sense_id": "cb9da03a-1fa3-3ec2-a9d6-4d646f216185",
                                                "text": "Acutis, the London-born Italian who on Sunday will become the Catholic church’s first millennial saint, built websites to spread Catholic teaching, earning him the nickname “God’s Influencer” after his death, aged 15, from leukaemia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cd548d03-0d14-49c6-9544-facb5c798687",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e165efe-e7b2-3951-822a-9df262a404cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "580a5bb2-c646-3525-b88b-a570fc1be564",
                        "target_lang_word": "Influencer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Influencer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                        "entry_id": "7eeefdeb-db6c-3efd-95f7-a6fcf6411ebd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die aufgrund ihres häufigen Auftretens und ihrer guten Reputation in ihrem sozialen Netzwerk als marktwirtschaftlich interessante Person, also als Werbeträger, in Frage kommt und so gegen Entgelt eingesetzt werden kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b78a7620-dfa3-4dcc-83fb-33b093c7a187",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "Der Influencer vermarktete das Produkt öffentlichkeitswirksam."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7542cd7-c8af-4354-9982-961dae1348ef",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "Influencer verpacken Werbebotschaften als freundschaftliche Empfehlung."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd106599-8ea8-4e60-8e33-0066fbb5f92a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "Influencer sorgen für Authentizität."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b043b66c-c230-40c2-8877-1987e766d7a1",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "„Du kannst als Influencer total viel Geld machen, schon als Teenager; […]“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2be46d35-78e3-47fe-814a-2367b09574e7",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "Wer regelmäßig im Netz unterwegs ist, kommt an Influencern nicht vorbei."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5910655a-66c4-452e-8879-51db191d3aa2",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "Posten für die Bundeswehr, Meetings im Kanzleramt, T-Shirts für das Entwicklungsministerium: Die Bundesregierung investiert massiv in Reichweiten auf Social Media. Doch dürfen Influencer auf ihren Kanälen überhaupt für den Staat werben?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0124c66f-5556-4df1-8af3-ab4b4be67d89",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0bb110-06a5-3994-9db8-557b07020dee",
                                                "text": "„Erst als die Influencer anfingen, die Produkte in die Kamera zu halten, ging das Geschäft richtig los.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
